Package: BayesianBenter
Title: Bayesian Estimation of the Benter Model for Rankings
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Michael", "Pearce", , "pearce790@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: An efficient Gibbs sampler for Bayesian inference in the Benter
    model for ranking data, a generalization of the Plackett-Luce model that
    introduces stage-specific dampening (noise) parameters. Estimation uses
    exponential and alpha-stable data augmentation that preserves conjugacy, 
    giving exact Gamma draws to worth parameters and MH updates of dampening 
    parameters. Both complete and partial (top-R) rankings are supported.
